  "content": "<div class=\"html-chunk\"><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>Given a number s in the form of string, the task is to check if the number is divisible by 5.&nbsp;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Examples:&nbsp;</strong></b></p><blockquote><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Input</strong></b><span>  : s = 56945255</span><br><b><strong>Output</strong></b><span> : true</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Input</strong></b><span>  : s = 12345</span><br><b><strong>Output</strong></b><span> : true</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\"><b><strong>Input</strong></b><span>  : s = 36358839596</span><br><b><strong>Output</strong></b><span> : false</span></p></blockquote></div><a id=\"practiceBanner\" class=\"ArticlePracticeBanner_practiceDivBanner__idAxy ArticlePracticeBanner_desktopOnly__r87aW rc0\" href=\"https://www.geeksforgeeks.org/problems/check-if-divisible-by-52730/1\" target=\"_blank\" style=\"display:block\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><div class=\"ArticlePracticeBanner_recommendedDiv__7Q5go\">Try It Yourself<div class=\"ArticlePracticeBanner_icon__UeNv9\"><img loading=\"lazy\" src=\"./images/dsa-3030-img-1.svg\" alt=\"redirect icon\" class=\"ArticlePracticeBanner_redirectIcon__mJJ_m undefined\"></div></div></a><div class=\"html-chunk\"><div id=\"table_of_content\"><p style=\"margin:4px; font-size:20px; font-weight:bold;\">Table of Content</p><ul><li><a href=\"#naive-approach-string-to-integer-conversion-on-time-and-o1-space\">[Naive Approach] &nbsp;Modulo Arithmetic with Large Numbers - O(n) Time and O(1) Space</a></li><li><a href=\"#optimal-approach-last-digit-check-o1-time-and-o1-space\">[Optimal Approach] Last Digit Check - O(1) Time and O(1) Space</a></li></ul></div><h3 id=\"naive-approach-string-to-integer-conversion-on-time-and-o1-space\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>[Naive Approach] &nbsp;Modulo Arithmetic with Large Numbers - O(n) Time and O(1) Space</span></h3><blockquote><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: start;\"><span>A number is divisible by 5 if its last digit is 0 or 5. For very large numbers given as strings, we can directly check the last character. Alternatively, compute remainder by processing digits left to right using modulo arithmetic.</span></p></blockquote><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Initialize rem = 0</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Iterate through each character in string</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>Update rem = (rem × 10 + digit) % 5</span></li><li value=\"4\"><span>Return true if rem == 0, else false</span></li></ul><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">C++</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"cpp\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-cpp\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">using</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">std</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'0'</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"56945255\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">boolalpha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel>\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">Java</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"java\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-java\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">java.util.*</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">class</span> <span class=\"nc\">GFG</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">boolean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">length</span><span class=\"p\">();</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"o\">++</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">charAt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">i</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'0'</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"56945255\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">System</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">out</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">println</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel>\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">Python</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"python3\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-python3\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">def</span> <span class=\"nf\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">rem</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"k\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">ch</span> <span class=\"ow\">in</span> <span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"n\">rem</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rem</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"nb\">int</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ch</span><span class=\"p\">))</span> <span class=\"o\">%</span> <span class=\"mi\">5</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rem</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"__main__\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">s</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"56945255\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel>\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">C#</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"csharp\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-csharp\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">using</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">System</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">GFG</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">foreach</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">            </span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'0'</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">Main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"56945255\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">Console</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">WriteLine</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel>\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">JavaScript</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"javascript\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-javascript\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">for</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kd\">let</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">ch</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">of</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"nx\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">*</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">10</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nb\">parseInt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">ch</span><span class=\"p\">))</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">%</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">5</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">rem</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">===</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">0</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">// Driver code</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"56945255\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">console</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">log</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">s</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><div class=\"code-output\"><br><strong>Output</strong><pre>true</pre></div><h3 id=\"optimal-approach-last-digit-check-o1-time-and-o1-space\" style=\"text-align:left\"><span>[Optimal Approach] Last Digit Check - O(1) Time and O(1) Space</span></h3><blockquote><p dir=\"ltr\"><span>A number is divisible by 5 if and only if its last digit is 0 or 5. Since the number can be very large (given as string), directly check the last character instead of converting to integer.</span></p></blockquote><ul><li value=\"1\"><span>Get last character of string using s.back().</span></li><li value=\"2\"><span>Return true if last digit is '0' or '5'.</span></li><li value=\"3\"><span>Return false otherwise.</span></li></ul><gfg-tabs data-mode=\"light\" data-run-ide=\"true\">\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">C++</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"cpp\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-cpp\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"cp\">#include</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"cpf\">&lt;bits/stdc++.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"k\">using</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">std</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&amp;</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// Get the last digit of the number</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">back</span><span class=\"p\">();</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// A number is divisible by 5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// if its last digit is 0 or 5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'0'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'5'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"kt\">int</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">()</span>\n<span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"56945255\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">cout</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">boolalpha</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">0</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel>\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">Java</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"java\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-java\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">java.util.*</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"kd\">class</span> <span class=\"nc\">GFG</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">boolean</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// Get the last digit of the number</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">charAt</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">length</span><span class=\"p\">()</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// A number is divisible by 5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// if its last digit is 0 or 5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'0'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'5'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">public</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kd\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"o\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">String</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"56945255\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">System</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">out</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"na\">println</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel>\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">Python</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"python3\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-python3\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">def</span> <span class=\"nf\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">):</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># Get the last digit of the number</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"c1\"># A number is divisible by 5</span>\n    <span class=\"c1\"># if its last digit is 0 or 5</span>\n    <span class=\"k\">return</span> <span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s1\">'0'</span> <span class=\"ow\">or</span> <span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s1\">'5'</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">if</span> <span class=\"vm\">__name__</span> <span class=\"o\">==</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"__main__\"</span><span class=\"p\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">s</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"56945255\"</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"nb\">print</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel>\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">C#</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"csharp\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-csharp\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"k\">using</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nn\">System</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"k\">class</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nc\">GFG</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">bool</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// Get the last digit of the number</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">char</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Length</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"m\">1</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// A number is divisible by 5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"c1\">// if its last digit is 0 or 5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'0'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">==</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"sc\">'5'</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">static</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">void</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nf\">Main</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"kt\">string</span><span class=\"p\">[]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">args</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"kt\">string</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s\">\"56945255\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"n\">Console</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"n\">WriteLine</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">s</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"p\">}</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel>\n            <gfg-tab slot=\"tab\">JavaScript</gfg-tab>\n<gfg-panel slot=\"panel\" data-code-lang=\"javascript\" data-main-code-start=\"None\" data-main-code-end=\"None\">\n    <code class=\"language-javascript\"><div class=\"highlight\"><pre><span></span><span class=\"kd\">function</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">s</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"p\">{</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// Get the last digit of the number</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">s</span><span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"nx\">s</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">length</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mf\">1</span><span class=\"p\">];</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// A number is divisible by 5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"c1\">// if its last digit is 0 or 5</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"k\">return</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">===</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'0'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">||</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">lastDigit</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">===</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s1\">'5'</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n<span class=\"p\">}</span>\n\n<span class=\"c1\">// Driver code</span>\n<span class=\"kd\">const</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"nx\">s</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"s2\">\"56945255\"</span><span class=\"p\">;</span>\n\n<span class=\"nx\">console</span><span class=\"p\">.</span><span class=\"nx\">log</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">divisibleBy5</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nx\">s</span><span class=\"p\">));</span>\n</pre></div></code>\n</gfg-panel></gfg-tabs><div class=\"code-output\"><br><strong>Output</strong><pre>true</pre></div></div>",
  "textContent": "Given a number s in the form of string, the task is to check if the number is divisible by 5. Examples: Input  : s = 56945255Output : trueInput  : s = 12345Output : trueInput  : s = 36358839596Output : falseTry It YourselfTable of Content[Naive Approach]  Modulo Arithmetic with Large Numbers - O(n) Time and O(1) Space[Optimal Approach] Last Digit Check - O(1) Time and O(1) Space[Naive Approach]  Modulo Arithmetic with Large Numbers - O(n) Time and O(1) SpaceA number is divisible by 5 if its last digit is 0 or 5. For very large numbers given as strings, we can directly check the last character. Alternatively, compute remainder by processing digits left to right using modulo arithmetic.Initialize rem = 0Iterate through each character in stringUpdate rem = (rem × 10 + digit) % 5Return true if rem == 0, else false\n            C++\n\n    #include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nbool divisibleBy5(string &s)\n{\n    int rem = 0;\n\n    for (char ch : s)\n    {\n        rem = (rem * 10 + (ch - '0')) % 5;\n    }\n\n    return (rem == 0);\n}\n\nint main()\n{\n    string s = \"56945255\";\n\n    cout << boolalpha << divisibleBy5(s);\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\n\n            Java\n\n    import java.util.*;\n\nclass GFG {\n    \n    static boolean divisibleBy5(String s) {\n        int rem = 0;\n        \n        for (int i = 0; i < s.length(); i++) {\n            rem = (rem * 10 + (s.charAt(i) - '0')) % 5;\n        }\n        \n        return (rem == 0);\n    }\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        String s = \"56945255\";\n        \n        System.out.println(divisibleBy5(s));\n    }\n}\n\n\n            Python\n\n    def divisibleBy5(s):\n    rem = 0\n    \n    for ch in s:\n        rem = (rem * 10 + int(ch)) % 5\n    \n    return (rem == 0)\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    s = \"56945255\"\n    \n    print(divisibleBy5(s))\n\n\n            C#\n\n    using System;\n\nclass GFG {\n    \n    static bool divisibleBy5(string s) {\n        int rem = 0;\n        \n        foreach (char ch in s) {\n            rem = (rem * 10 + (ch - '0')) % 5;\n        }\n        \n        return (rem == 0);\n    }\n    \n    static void Main(string[] args) {\n        string s = \"56945255\";\n        \n        Console.WriteLine(divisibleBy5(s));\n    }\n}\n\n\n            JavaScript\n\n    function divisibleBy5(s) {\n    let rem = 0;\n    \n    for (let ch of s) {\n        rem = (rem * 10 + parseInt(ch)) % 5;\n    }\n    \n    return (rem === 0);\n}\n\n// Driver code\nconst s = \"56945255\";\n\nconsole.log(divisibleBy5(s));\n\nOutputtrue[Optimal Approach] Last Digit Check - O(1) Time and O(1) SpaceA number is divisible by 5 if and only if its last digit is 0 or 5. Since the number can be very large (given as string), directly check the last character instead of converting to integer.Get last character of string using s.back().Return true if last digit is '0' or '5'.Return false otherwise.\n            C++\n\n    #include <bits/stdc++.h>\nusing namespace std;\n\nbool divisibleBy5(string &s)\n{\n    // Get the last digit of the number\n    char lastDigit = s.back();\n\n    // A number is divisible by 5\n    // if its last digit is 0 or 5\n    return (lastDigit == '0' || lastDigit == '5');\n}\n\nint main()\n{\n    string s = \"56945255\";\n\n    cout << boolalpha << divisibleBy5(s);\n\n    return 0;\n}\n\n\n            Java\n\n    import java.util.*;\n\nclass GFG {\n    \n    static boolean divisibleBy5(String s) {\n        // Get the last digit of the number\n        char lastDigit = s.charAt(s.length() - 1);\n        \n        // A number is divisible by 5\n        // if its last digit is 0 or 5\n        return (lastDigit == '0' || lastDigit == '5');\n    }\n    \n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        String s = \"56945255\";\n        \n        System.out.println(divisibleBy5(s));\n    }\n}\n\n\n            Python\n\n    def divisibleBy5(s):\n    # Get the last digit of the number\n    lastDigit = s[-1]\n    \n    # A number is divisible by 5\n    # if its last digit is 0 or 5\n    return lastDigit == '0' or lastDigit == '5'\n\nif __name__ == \"__main__\":\n    s = \"56945255\"\n    \n    print(divisibleBy5(s))\n\n\n            C#\n\n    using System;\n\nclass GFG {\n    \n    static bool divisibleBy5(string s) {\n        // Get the last digit of the number\n        char lastDigit = s[s.Length - 1];\n        \n        // A number is divisible by 5\n        // if its last digit is 0 or 5\n        return (lastDigit == '0' || lastDigit == '5');\n    }\n    \n    static void Main(string[] args) {\n        string s = \"56945255\";\n        \n        Console.WriteLine(divisibleBy5(s));\n    }\n}\n\n\n            JavaScript\n\n    function divisibleBy5(s) {\n    // Get the last digit of the number\n    const lastDigit = s[s.length - 1];\n    \n    // A number is divisible by 5\n    // if its last digit is 0 or 5\n    return lastDigit === '0' || lastDigit === '5';\n}\n\n// Driver code\nconst s = \"56945255\";\n\nconsole.log(divisibleBy5(s));\n\nOutputtrue",
